WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 13.2 · Strategy to Action: Plan, Deliver & Review
Organisational KPIs and targets

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Few balanced KPIs, with baselines and targets, show whether the year is on track.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. One to three KPIs per objective, no more.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Balance delivery, results, money, people and stakeholders.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Add quarterly steps so drift shows early.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: visitors from the most deprived areas, 22% now, 30% by March 2028; shop profit covering 18% of charity costs.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your KPI set with baselines, targets and owners.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
